    {
      "from": "p_rosa",
      "minute": 0,
      "text": "morning team. launch planning thread: where are we on the Kestrel Outdoor site?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sam",
      "minute": 1,
      "text": "homepage is done, product pages are about 70%"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sami",
      "minute": 2,
      "text": "copy for the product pages lands tomorrow, I'm waiting on the client's sizing chart"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 3,
      "text": "Current target is the launch on the 12th. Want me to track the sizing chart as a blocker?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_rosa",
      "minute": 4,
      "text": "yes please. and fyi I'm officially art director as of this week, so sign-offs come to me"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sam",
      "minute": 5,
      "text": "congrats Rosa!!"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sami",
      "minute": 6,
      "text": "🎉"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sam",
      "minute": 8,
      "text": "ok lunch? the ramen place or the falafel truck"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sami",
      "minute": 9,
      "text": "falafel, ramen queue is insane on fridays"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_rosa",
      "minute": 10,
      "text": "falafel. also who keeps playing that synthwave playlist on the office speaker lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sam",
      "minute": 11,
      "text": "guilty"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 12,
      "text": "Falafel it is. If the sizing chart slips, you could move the launch to the 18th."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_rosa",
      "minute": 13,
      "text": "let's not move anything yet, we hold the 12th unless the client is late"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sami",
      "minute": 14,
      "text": "agree, hold the 12th"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sami",
      "minute": 40,
      "text": "separate news: I'm moving to the Helsinki office in January, it's official"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sam",
      "minute": 41,
      "text": "noooo. but also nice, you've wanted that for ages"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_rosa",
      "minute": 42,
      "text": "we'll miss you Sami. we'll sort a handover plan for Kestrel"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 43,
      "text": "Congratulations, Sami. Shall I draft a handover checklist for the Kestrel account?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_rosa",
      "minute": 44,
      "text": "yes, due before christmas"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sam",
      "minute": 46,
      "text": "back to launch: client just sent the sizing chart 🙌"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sami",
      "minute": 47,
      "text": "great, copy will be in by end of day then"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_rosa",
      "minute": 48,
      "text": "so we're green for the 12th"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 49,
      "text": "Great, the sizing chart blocker is cleared and the launch stays on the 12th."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sam",
      "minute": 50,
      "text": "I'll do a final QA pass on mobile thursday"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_rosa",
      "minute": 51,
      "text": "perfect"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_sami",
